  "prompt": "Build a check report on the text keys of products. This table may hold errors. Return one row for each of three checks, with three columns, in this order: check_name, n_bad and result. The checks are 'sku_case', the products whose sku holds a lower-case letter; 'sku_spaces', the products whose sku holds a space anywhere in it; and 'tv_spelling', the products whose category_raw names the parent category TV & Video itself, spelled 'tv & video', 'tv en video', 'tv/video' or 'téléviseurs' once letter case and spaces at the start or end are ignored. result is 'pass' when n_bad is 0, otherwise 'fail'. Any row order is fine.",
